@startuml
title Home Dashboard 数据聚合流程

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Home Dashboard" as Home
participant "window.api.system" as SystemApi
participant "window.api.kb" as KbApi
participant "window.api.codeRepo" as CodeApi
participant "window.api.agent" as AgentApi
participant "window.api.intel" as IntelApi
participant "window.api.music" as MusicApi
participant "Electron Main" as Main
database "App SQLite" as DB
participant "Service Manager" as Services
database "local-intel SQLite" as IntelDB

User -> Home: 打开首页
Home -> SystemApi: getAppStatus()
Home -> KbApi: getIndexStatus()
Home -> CodeApi: listRepositories()
Home -> AgentApi: listSessions()
Home -> IntelApi: getDashboardSummary()
Home -> MusicApi: getPlaybackState()

SystemApi -> Main: system:status:get
KbApi -> Main: kb:index:status
CodeApi -> Main: codeRepo:list
AgentApi -> Main: agent:session:list
IntelApi -> Main: intel:summary:get
MusicApi -> Main: music:playback:state

Main -> Services: 服务状态
Main -> DB: 应用状态、任务、最近项目、音乐状态
Main -> IntelDB: 今日情报摘要和观察雷达

Main --> Home: 聚合卡片数据
Home --> User: 展示今日入口和异常状态

@enduml
